//  Export all item under the project to a folder as a HTML report.

/*
  This scipts export all item under the project to a folder as a HTML report.
*/

//**********************************  History  ******************************
// M. Serdar Karaman       2022-05-25  Initial version. It exports as txt file.
// M. Serdar Karaman       2022-06-07  Export into html format with css and js. 
// M. Serdar Karaman       2022-06-10  Works with batch mode of Doors. 
// M. Serdar Karaman       2024-08-14  Add modulename and baseline information to the footer. 
// M. Serdar Karaman       2026-09-25  Folders are created in the right order and only when needed, sub-projects
//                                     are exported, link texts are short plain text, linked modules stay open
//                                     between modules, progress bar with cancel, errors are logged instead of
//                                     shown in dialogs, "Export" view is used when a module has one.
// M. Serdar Karaman       2026-09-28  Large pictures are shown at a medium size and open enlarged on click.
// M. Serdar Karaman       2026-10-01  List bullets are written as a Unicode character instead of the bullet.gif image.

